\tag{fnip}
\title{Existence and uniqueness}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{A [trajectory](fnip-0009) is a curve whose velocity is the value of
the [vector field](fnip-0009). The Morris–Lecar equations assign one
such velocity at every point of the plane, and
\ref{fnip-0011} draws one solution.}

\p{On what time interval is that curve the trajectory through its
starting point, and does another curve start at the same point?}

\transclude{fnip-0028}
